    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Imposes a duty on the State to ensure responsible parents maintain their children's citizenship.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "The Minister shall cause to be served on the person, either personally or by post, a copy of that order.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The State must provide notice to the person before directing them to cease being an Australian citizen.";
